## S0 — Scaffold & demo canvas

**Gate:** Open `/` and `/app` (or `/app/edit`); sample page visible at `#monet-preview-root`.

| ID | Subtask | Role | Parallel? | Owns | Deliverable |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| S0-A | Bootstrap Next.js + TS + CSS Modules | `scaffold` | serial first | `package.json`, `tsconfig`, `next.config.*`, `app/layout.tsx`, `styles/` | `dev` works |
| S0-B | Domain stubs: UUID helpers, Zod schemas | `domain` | after S0-A | `lib/schemas/`, `lib/ids.ts` | Match TRD §5.1 |
| S0-C | Marketing route: brand-first hero + CTA | `craft` | ∥ S0-D | `app/page.tsx`, marketing styles | Brand-forward `/` |
| S0-D | Workspace shell: chrome, mode toggle placeholder | `ui` | ∥ S0-C | `app/app/**` or `app/edit/**` | Empty workspace layout |
| S0-E | Preview host + sample landing + `data-monet-id`s | `preview` | ∥ S0-C/D | `components/preview/`, `samples/landing/` | `hero-cta`, `primary-nav`, `signup-form` |
| S0-F | Mode machine skeleton: Interact ↔ Select | `domain` | after S0-A | `lib/session/` | Zustand store + mode enum |
| S0-G | Wire preview; fixed preview width | `ui` | after S0-D+E | workspace page | Preview mounted |

**Merge:** S0-A → (S0-B ∥ S0-C ∥ S0-D ∥ S0-E) → S0-F → S0-G.

**Checkpoint:** When this stage is complete, respond with a full update: what is done (subtask IDs + deliverables), what remains if anything, and concrete how-to-test steps (routes, commands, expected UI/behavior, gate check). Do not start the next stage until the gate is verified.

